    "moreDescription": "The Rigol DHO924S is a 4-channel 200MHz 12-bit oscilloscope with 2GSa/s sample rate and up to 200Mpts memory depth. Features include hardware-accelerated waveform display, 12-bit vertical resolution, and comprehensive trigger modes. Supports SCPI over LAN (port 5555) and USB-TMC.\n\nFamily covers: DHO924S (200MHz 12-bit), DHO914S (100MHz 12-bit), DHO924 (200MHz 8-bit), DHO914 (100MHz 8-bit).\n\nNote: Verify IDN string prefix on your firmware \u2014 some units return 'RIGOL TECHNOLOGIES' rather than 'Rigol Technologies'."
